Rama travels with Sita and brahmanas to Sutikshna --- Rama finds secluded bark-garlanded forest ashram --- Mud-matted Sutikshna embraces and welcomes Rama --- Sage tells awaiting Rama delayed heaven-going --- Sage offers tapas-won worlds for household dwelling --- Rama vows winning worlds himself seeks forest lodging --- Sage invites stay among fearless roaming deer --- Rama fears bow would harm deer declines long stay --- Sutikshna serves ascetic feast after evening rites